# UI/UX Design System

## 🎨 Color System

### Primary Palette (Bell Crab Theme)

**Warm & Friendly Color Palette**

```css
:root {
    /* Primary Colors */
    --primary-color: #FA8A59;      /* Crab Coral - Primary Actions */
    --primary-dark: #E8774A;       /* Darker shade for hover states */
    
    /* Secondary Colors */
    --secondary-color: #F4D273;    /* Bell Gold - Premium/Success */
    
    /* Brand Colors */
    --brand-blue: #6A7CED;         /* Clay Blue - Brand Color A */
    --brand-purple: #9E75E9;       /* Soft Amethyst - Brand Color B */
    
    /* Semantic Colors */
    --danger-color: #FF6B6B;       /* Soft red for danger/errors */
    --success-color: #F4D273;      /* Bell Gold for success */
    
    /* Background Colors */
    --bg-color: #F9F9FC;           /* Off-White - Background UI */
    --card-bg: #ffffff;            /* Pure White for cards */
    --bg-gradient-top: #5e5eb4;   /* Deep blue-purple */
    --bg-gradient-bottom: #8094ce; /* Light blue */
    
    /* Text Colors */
    --text-primary: #33334D;       /* Deep Slate - Primary Text */
    --text-secondary: #5F5F7A;     /* Medium Slate - Secondary Text */
    
    /* Border & Shadow */
    --border-color: #E8E8F0;       /* Soft border */
    --shadow: 0 2px 8px 0 rgba(106, 124, 237, 0.08), 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    --shadow-lg: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(106, 124, 237, 0.15), 0 4px 10px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    --shadow-soft: 0 4px 12px 0 rgba(250, 138, 89, 0.12);
    
    /* Gradients */
    --gradient-brand: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-blue) 0%, var(--brand-purple) 100%);
}
```

### Color Usage Guidelines

- **Primary Color**: Primary buttons, active states, main CTAs
- **Secondary Color**: Success states, premium features, highlights
- **Brand Blue**: Navigation, links, accents
- **Brand Purple**: Hover states, gradients, premium elements
- **Danger**: Delete actions, errors, warnings
- **Success**: Completed states, success messages

## 📐 Spacing System

```css
:root {
    --spacing-xs: 4px;    /* 0.25rem */
    --spacing-sm: 8px;    /* 0.5rem */
    --spacing-md: 16px;   /* 1rem */
    --spacing-lg: 24px;   /* 1.5rem */
    --spacing-xl: 32px;   /* 2rem */
    --spacing-2xl: 48px;  /* 3rem */
}
```

## 🔲 Border Radius

```css
:root {
    --radius-sm: 12px;   /* Small elements */
    --radius-md: 16px;   /* Default */
    --radius-lg: 24px;   /* Large elements */
    --radius-xl: 32px;   /* Extra large */
    --radius-pill: 999px; /* Pills */
}
```

## 📱 Responsive Breakpoints

- **Mobile**: < 521px (default styles)
- **Tablet**: 521px - 768px
- **Desktop**: 769px - 980px
- **Large Desktop**: 981px+

## 🎯 Touch Targets (MANDATORY)

**ALL interactive elements MUST be ≥ 48x48px (Lighthouse requirement)**

⚠️ **CRITICAL**: Touch targets MUST be 48px minimum, NOT 24px! This is mandatory for Lighthouse 100% scores.

```css
:root {
    --touch-target-min: 48px;  /* Lighthouse requirement - NOT 24px! */
    --touch-target-spacing: 8px;
}

/* Enforcement with !important */
button, .btn, .tab, a[role="button"], label[for] {
    min-width: var(--touch-target-min) !important;
    min-height: var(--touch-target-min) !important;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}
```

## 🎨 Typography

```css
font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', sans-serif;
```

## 📱 Mobile-First Patterns

- Use mobile-first CSS (default styles for mobile)
- Stack vertically on mobile, horizontal on desktop
- Single column grids on mobile, multi-column on desktop
- Full-width containers on mobile, max-width on desktop

## 🎯 Best Practices

- ✅ Use CSS variables for all colors
- ✅ Follow mobile-first responsive design
- ✅ Ensure all touch targets ≥ 48x48px (NOT 24px!)
- ✅ Use semantic HTML elements
- ✅ Provide focus indicators with proper contrast
- ✅ Optimize animations (use transform/opacity only)
- ✅ Add will-change for animated elements
- ✅ Include skip navigation link
- ✅ Set HTML lang attribute
- ✅ Include meta description

## 🚀 Performance Optimization

### Animation Guidelines

```css
/* Use GPU-accelerated properties only */
.animated-element {
    will-change: transform, opacity;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
}

/* Avoid layout-triggering properties */
/* ❌ Don't animate: width, height, top, left, margin, padding */
/* ✅ Do animate: transform, opacity */
```

### Focus Indicators

```css
button:focus-visible,
.tab:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--brand-blue);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(106, 124, 237, 0.2);
}
```

### Skip Navigation

```css
.skip-nav {
    position: absolute;
    top: -40px;
    left: 0;
    background: var(--primary-color);
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    z-index: 100;
    transition: top 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
}

.skip-nav:focus {
    top: 20px;
    left: 20px;
}
```

